            printf("\n");
        }
    }
    printf("\n");
}
```

This code will print the contents of the `rxdataF` variable, with each row representing a separate receive antenna (`ru->nb_rx`). The inner loop iterates over the elements of each row, printing their values.

Note that this code assumes that `NUMBER_RX_BUFFERS`, `fp->symbols_per_slot`, and `fp->ofdm_symbol_size` are defined and accessible in the current scope.

### Example Use Case

